      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/c67d28/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-15T19:12:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was holding off on attaching the figures to their bases since I felt like it would be cool to paint them. &nbsp;That being the case, I did look at how bad it would be to test fit. &nbsp;I noticed that the nubs for the figures and the holes in the base were pretty tolerance-wise and I concerned about breaking it when putting them together (my Legacy figure really looks like it might have that problem). &nbsp;Does anyone have any suggestions about how best to mount the figures to the bases? &nbsp;Thanks.</p>",
