      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e47c2d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-20T04:12:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Has anyone painted there minis yet?? I'm interested in how there turned out. What kind of paints should I use? Citadel paints? Any advice would be awesome. Not sure if war hammer paints are best for this.</p>",
