    {
      "id": 114983,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-20T13:53:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've got Citadel paints, which I used very successfully on the GSF minis (after they'd been primered). &nbsp;I've had a bit of a setback with primering my Tactics minis (see my other thread on that tragic subject), but I fully intend to use the same paints on the Tactics minis.</p><p>I'm planning on experimenting - I've got some minis which I've just washed with soap/water first and some I'll primer with what's left of my old primer, to see which experience is better. &nbsp;I'll report back once I have some results to share.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:01.769Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
