      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve got Citadel paints, which I used very successfully on the GSF minis (after they&#39;d been primered). &nbsp;I&#39;ve had a bit of a setback with primering my Tactics minis (see my other thread on that tragic subject), but I fully intend to use the same paints on the Tactics minis.</p><p>I&#39;m planning on experimenting - I&#39;ve got some minis which I&#39;ve just washed with soap/water first and some I&#39;ll primer with what&#39;s left of my old primer, to see which experience is better. &nbsp;I&#39;ll report back once I have some results to share.</p>",
